{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/91","id":5379129368,"node_id":"PR_kwDOViCSL88AAAABQJ8AGA","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/91","diff_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/91.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/91.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/91","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/91/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/91/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/91/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/statuses/ba5b183379b00c464e82d67a0f519d3b32869c3c","number":91,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Audit receipt consumer mutation before prerequisite reuse","user":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bounded consumer-mutation audit toward #4. [Prospective protocol](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/4#issuecomment-6981335805) was public before source or collection.\n\n**Question:** Do six nested timing receipt consumers or the complete saved-archive reader mutate their seven freshly returned prerequisite graphs?\n\n**Result:** No mutation was observed in this original read. The qualified audit source and six-role check record were published at `9b40113` before collection. The [six raw output files and manifest](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/receipt-consumer-mutation/results/receipt-consumer-mutation/raw/manifest.json) were published separately at `1e9714f` before rendering. The Python 3.11.17/NumPy 2.4.6 and Python 3.12.15/NumPy 2.5.4 commands took 84.845 and 73.026 seconds, including startup, under the 180-second cap. All six nested graphs matched after their timing receipt returned, and all seven matched after the complete read. The original reader replayed 480 profiles with zero chip and unitless error. Both runtimes have identical full graph and semantic witnesses.\n\nThe [data-only report](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/receipt-consumer-mutation/results/receipt-consumer-mutation/report.json) reproduces byte-for-byte on both locked runtimes with poker reader imports blocked. Four focused report tests reject changed evidence and blocked imports. The complete [source check archive](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/receipt-consumer-mutation/results/receipt-consumer-mutation/source-checks/manifest.json) records two clean local base suites (5,582 passed each), two complete optional suites (2,491 passed each), both passing hosted source jobs in [CI #565](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44339006308), exact versions, raw logs and source tree proof. Preliminary dirty-checkout failures and an incomplete optional scope remain retained and excluded.\n\n**Pending:** final exact report-head local and hosted checks, check archive, then history-preserving merge. The prior 912.54/900 forecast, 2.390%/1% known-game accuracy and rejected full-context-copy result remain failed. This result does not admit a shared graph or speedup; a separate prospective complete ordinary/reuse protocol is required.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-18T15:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:29:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"dfb2a3e88a098a99591fadc2456d5baf16844b28","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/receipt-consumer-mutation","ref":"research/receipt-consumer-mutation","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Personal poker AI research: simulation, CFR, reproducible Hold'em experiments, and independent solver comparisons.","homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"fork